OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhy did an OpenAI system hack
OL,4,AAustralia's health system - and can it
OL,5,Abe stopped in the future?
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn OpenAI agent has gone "rogue" and
OL,8,F"infiltrated" an Australian government
OL,9,Fwebsite in what cyber-security experts
OL,10,Fare calling the first hack of its kind.
OL,12,FBut why did it take the government
OL,13,Fmonths to discover what happened - and
OL,14,Fcould it happen again?
OL,16,FThe hack was carried out by an AI agent
OL,17,F- an autonomous computer program that
OL,18,Fuses AI to complete a task with minimal
OL,19,Fhuman oversight.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
