OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFederal judge delays ruling on White
OL,4,AHouse media ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA federal judge has heard arguments
OL,7,Fbetween the Trump Administration and
OL,8,Fthree news organisations over the
OL,9,Fdecision to bar them from reporting
OL,10,Finside White House grounds.
OL,12,FIn a brief hearing in Washington on
OL,13,FWednesday, Judge Timothy Kelly weighed
OL,14,Fa request from CNN, Politico and MS NOW
OL,15,Ffor a temporary restraining order to
OL,16,Furgently restore White House passes to
OL,17,F78 reporters.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790266697
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFederal judge delays ruling on White
OL,4,AHouse media ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lawyer for the media outlets said
OL,7,Fthat the White House is falsely arguing
OL,8,Fthat national security concerns justify
OL,9,Fthe ban. A justice department lawyer
OL,10,Fsaid the president has the right to
OL,11,F"exclude anyone he wants" from certain
OL,12,Flocations inside the White House.
OL,14,FThe judge said he would come to a
OL,15,Fdecision as soon as he could.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
